          ask for a new version prepared by AI at no cost,
        </li>
        <li>a two-page sample of chapter 1 in the final typeset form.</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>For a fee,</strong> the Service generates the whole Book: it researches the topic
      and prepares a detailed outline, which the User reviews, may edit (and may have re-planned
      once at no cost) and approves; it then writes the chapters, edits their language, checks
      consistency and typesets the Book. The result is a PDF and an EPUB file with a cover.
    </li>
    <li>
