    <li>
      <strong>Improve with AI.</strong> For each Book the User may make up to 3 AI edits. Each
      change is first shown as a preview, which the User accepts or discards.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Check by a human.</strong> For each Book the User may submit up to 3 correction
      requests free of charge; they are handled by an editor.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Reviews.</strong> The User may rate the Book. A review is shown on the Service's
      website only if the User gives separate, voluntary consent.
    </li>
  </ol>

